---@field attestationToken? string The App Check token. App Check tokens are signed [JWTs](https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7519/) containing claims that identify the attested app and GCP project. This token is used to access Google services protected by App Check. These tokens can also be [verified by your own custom backends](https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-check/custom-resource-backend) using the Firebase Admin SDK or third-party libraries.
